// Free Cash Flow
// Table: Balance Sheet
// Display folder: 01-base
// Format: #,##0
// Hidden: false
// Operating Cash Flow minus CapEx (PaymentsToAcquirePropertyPlantAndEquipment). Returns BLANK when CapEx is missing (NVIDIA companyfacts drops this concept after mid-FY2020).

Free Cash Flow =
VAR _ocf = [Operating Cash Flow]
VAR _capex = [CapEx]
RETURN
IF(ISBLANK(_capex), BLANK(), _ocf - _capex)
